  "ai.orion81Builds": "I-Orion-81 yakhelwe kwisofthiwe ye-open-source ebhalwe ngabantu. Ibhalwe apha kuba ingenziwanga yi-AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>I-Orion-81 yiprojekthi eyenziwe ngokupheleleyo yi-AI.<\/0> Umgca ngamnye wekhowudi ye-Orion-81 ngokwayo ubhalwe nge-Claude Code, ikhokelwa ngumsunguli. Inqanawa nganye, imephu, i-texture nesandi zenziwe zizixhobo ezibhalwe yi-Claude Code. Umsunguli unquma into ekufuneka yakhiwe; i-Claude Code ifumana indlela. Iilayibrari ze-open-source ezakhelwe kuzo ziludwe ngezantsi phantsi kwe-'Ayenziwanga yi-AI'. Into enye isavulekile kwaye ibonakaliswa ngokuphandle: <1>uhlolo lwelayisensi<\/1> yekhowudi yomdlalo eyaphuma kwiprotayipu ye-GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "I-Orion yaqala ngomhla wama-28 kuSeptemba 2026 njengeprotayipu kwinjini ye-open-source ye-Quake III Arena (GPL), iinqanawa ze-Elite Dangerous ziyinkuthazo yayo. Ngosuku lwesibini ikhowudi yomdlalo yafudukela kwi-BuB, injini entsha ebhalwe nge-Claude Code; iimodyuli zomdlalo zaphuma kwiprotayipu zaza zatshintshelwa amagama. Ukukhutshwa kwe-0.3.0 kwanika zonke iididi ezili-16 zeenqanawa imizimba emitsha yazo. Uhlolo lokuthotyelwa kwelayisensi luhlola ukuba ikhona na ikhowudi esadityaniswa nemvelaphi ye-GPL, nokuba imizobo yokuqala yeenqanawa ayisondeli kakhulu kwinkuthazo yayo. Uhlolo oluzenzekelayo lokufana kwekhowudi nomthombo weprotayipu ye-GPL lwenziwa ngomhla we-8 kuOktobha 2026, kwaye uhlolo lweengcali lwezo zihambelaniso luyaqhubeka. Nantoni na eyenziweyo ngokuvela kwenye iya kubhalwa kwakhona okanye iyilwe kwakhona.",
