  "d.109szp9": "Umhlaba oqinileyo okanye izakhiwo ongaqubisana nazo.",
  "d.10azxrl": "Iiradiyasi zelanga ezintathu ngaphezu kwefotosifiya. Umthunzi bubomi: ikhaka leqonga, ikhomethi, imizimba emikhulu. Iiflaya ziza rhoqo emva kwemizuzu embalwa.",
