  "economy.todayHead": "Okukhoyo namhlanje",
  "economy.todayLead": "Amanqanaba omzimba nekhaka nemibala yekhaka kwisikrini se-LOADOUT (0.6.0) abonisa uhlobo loluphuculo nokuhombisa uqoqosho olujolise ekubonelelweni.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Kuba imali engenayo yawo yenzelwe ukubahlawula. Umdlalo uqala wenziwe ngokupheleleyo yi-AI ukuze ukwazi ukubakho konke; abayili abahlawulelwayo emva koko batshintsha umsebenzi we-AI, benikwa isidima ngamagama.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ndingadlala kwi-intanethi?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Ngaba mahala ukudlala?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Imibuzo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Hayi okwangoku. Umdlalo wabadlali abaninzi we-LAN kuthungelwano olunye uyasebenza namhlanje (ukusukela kwi-0.2.0); ukudlala kwi-intanethi akukhiwanga.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Iprotayipu yakhiwa kwinjini ye-open-source ye-Quake III Arena (GPL) kwaye yathatha iinqanawa ze-Elite Dangerous njengenkuthazo. Ngosuku lwesibini ikhowudi yomdlalo yafudukela kwi-BuB, injini entsha ebhalwe nge-Claude Code; iimodyuli zomdlalo zaphuma kwiprotayipu zaza zatshintshelwa amagama. Ukukhutshwa kwe-0.3.0 kwanika zonke iididi ezili-16 zeenqanawa imizimba emitsha. Uhlolo lokuthotyelwa kwelayisensi luhlola ukuba ikhona na ikhowudi esadityaniswa nemvelaphi ye-GPL nokuba imizobo yokuqala yeenqanawa ayisondeli kakhulu kwinkuthazo yayo. Uhlolo oluzenzekelayo lokufana kwekhowudi nomthombo weprotayipu ye-GPL lwenziwa ngomhla we-<0/>, kwaye uhlolo lweengcali lwezo zihambelaniso luyaqhubeka. Nantoni na eyenziweyo ngokuvela kwenye iya kubhalwa kwakhona okanye iyilwe kwakhona. Kude kugqitywe uhlolo, asithi impendulo ithi hayi.",
  "faq.questions": "Imibuzo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Iinqanawa, ubugcisa, imiboniso nokunye, njengoko imali engenayo ivuma. <0>Incwadi yeli phepha<\/0> ibhala yonke into kwaye iya kubonisa ukutshintshwa ngalinye nomyili walo.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Iinqanawa nophuculo zicetywe ukuba zizuzwe ngokudlala okanye zithengwe. Indlela iinqanawa ezihlawulelwayo ezihlala zilungile ngayo kumlo wabadlali ngabadlali isaqulunqwa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Eli lelicebo: mahala ukudlala kunye nemali yasemdlalweni ekhethwa ngokuzithandela nezinto zokuhombisa. Akukakhiwa okwangoku.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ngaba umsebenzi womntu uye wakhutshelwa?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Iphuma nini, kwaye kuyiphi into?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Ngawaphi amacandelo abantu aza kuwatshintsha, kwaye ndiza kwazi njani?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Kutheni umdlalo owenziwe yi-AI unganceda abayili?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Ngaba uza kuba kukutyala ukuze uphumelele?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Akukho mhla wokukhutshwa kwaye akukho xabiso okwangoku.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "I-Anthropic, i-Claude ne-Claude Code zizimpawu zorhwebo ze-Anthropic, PBC. I-Unreal Engine ne-Epic Games zizimpawu zorhwebo ze-Epic Games, Inc. I-Blender sisimpawu sorhwebo se-Blender Foundation. I-Quake III Arena ne-Elite Dangerous zizimpawu zorhwebo zabanini bazo. Onke amagama ngawabanini bawo kwaye asetyenziselwa ukuchonga iimveliso ezikhankanyiweyo kuphela. I-Orion-81 ayinabudlelwane, ayixhaswanga okanye ayivunywanga nguwo nawuphi na kuzo.",
