  "footer.oneItemStill": "Into enye isavulekile: <0>uhlolo lwelayisensi<\/0> yekhowudi yomdlalo eyaphuma kwiprotayipu ye-GPL. Uhlolo oluzenzekelayo lokufana kwekhowudi nomthombo weprotayipu lwenziwa ngomhla we-<1/>, kwaye uhlolo lweengcali lwezo zihambelaniso luyaqhubeka.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>I-Orion-81 yiprojekthi eyenziwe ngokupheleleyo yi-AI.<\/0> Ikhowudi ye-Orion-81 ngokwayo ibhalwe yi-Claude Code, ikhokelwa ngumsunguli; iinqanawa, iimephu, ii-texture nezandi ziveliswe zizixhobo ezibhalwe yi-Claude Code. Iilayibrari ze-open-source ezisetyenziswayo ziludwe phantsi kwe-<1>'Ayenziwanga yi-AI'<\/1>.",
