  "proof.since202610": "Ukususela ngo-2026-10-03 (inguqulelo 0.2.1 ukuya phambili), imodeli yomceli (Claude Opus 5.5) ibhala icebo nemigaqo yokwamkelwa kuluhlu lomsebenzi. Iimodeli zabenzi (Claude Sonnet 5.5) zakha ngaxeshanye, nganye kwiifayile zayo. Umceli uyahlola, abenzi bayalungisa, uvavanyo luyasebenza, kwaye kuphela emva koko inguqulelo iqinisiwe. Iinguqulelo zangaphambili (v0 ukuya kwi-0.2.0) zacetywa zaza zakhiwa yi-Claude Code ngemodeli enye.",
