  "why.anthropic": "Kwi-Anthropic",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Isalathisi soqoqosho se-Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> sifumanisa ukuba abasebenzi abasaqala umsebenzi babona uninzi lomsebenzi wabo unokwenziwa yi-AI.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Isakhelo sombutho woqoqosho se-Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> sicela iinkampani ukuba ziqeqeshe kwakhona kwaye zibuyisele abantu endaweni yokunqumla.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Uphononongo lwe-Anthropic lobungqina bokuqeqeshwa kwakhona (<1/>)<\/0> lufumanisa ukuba iinkqubo ezidityaniswe nabaqeshi, ezithile kwishishini, zisebenza kakuhle.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Isicelo silula: izihlalo ezintlanu ze-Claude ukuqala. Ukuba umsunguli angazalisa ngabantu abanesakhono nabakhuthele, siya kubonisa indlela i-AI enokusetyenziswa ngayo ngenjongo elungileyo ukwenza into entle.",
  "why.context": "Imvelaphi yomxholo",
  "why.designersEngineers": "Kubayili nonjineli",
  "why.everyItemBelow": "Into nganye engezantsi yicebo okanye isalindele ukubhengezwa. Akukho nto apha eyavunyelwana ngayo, kwaye akukho nani lithenjisiweyo.",
  "why.founderWentFrom": "Umsunguli uvela kwiprotayipu waya kwi-0.6.1 kwiintsuku ezi-<0/>. Cinga ngento eqela elizinikeleyo labantu abahlanu elinokuyenza.",
  "why.fromAnthropic": "Ukusuka kwi-Anthropic",
  "why.fromBackers": "Ukusuka kubaxhasi",
  "why.fullyDisclosedAi": "Umdlalo owenziwe yi-AI ocaciswe ngokupheleleyo onenjongo abadlali abanokuyihlola, ocetywe ukufudukela kwi-Unreal Engine 5 (isigaba 3 sesicwangciso).",
  "why.fullyDocumentedExample": "Umzekelo ophelelisiweyo wokwakha ngokusebenzisa iiarhente, ukusuka kwinjini ukuya kumdlalo (ugcino, uluhlu lomsebenzi nenguqulelo nganye eqinisiweyo zigciniwe), novavanyo oluncinci olusebenzayo lwendlela enye iinzuzo ze-AI ezinokuxhasa ngayo abantu ezibakhupha.",
  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Injongo yenkxaso mali: iza kubhengezwa.",
